title: Foundry AI Gateway Accelerator
message: >-
  If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Muazu
    family-names: Isah
    affiliation: Microsoft
repository-code: https://github.com/zuman88/azure-ai-gateway-cost-attribution
abstract: >-
  Production-grade Terraform for running Azure API Management as a centralised
  AI Gateway in front of Microsoft Foundry model deployments, with optional
  per-application cost attribution and chargeback. Covers backend pools with
  circuit breakers, managed-identity egress, Entra ID caller authentication,
  token governance, and a per-request chargeback ledger reconciled against
  Azure Cost Management.
keywords:
  - azure
  - api-management
  - ai-gateway
  - terraform
  - finops
  - llmops
